# Settings read when the till is BUILT (npm run build / docker build).
# They are baked into the JavaScript; changing one needs a rebuild.
#
# To use: copy to .env.production (real builds) or .env.development
# (npm run dev). Both are gitignored. Docker does NOT read these files
# (.dockerignore leaves them out): there, use the build-arg, see README.md.

# Where the API is. No slash at the end.
#
# Empty or missing in a real build: the same address the till was loaded
# from. Right for the server, where Caddy sends /api to the API.
# Missing with npm run dev: http://localhost:5077.
#
# Set it only if the API lives on a different address from the till:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
VITE_API_URL=
